gTk(){return"No. The general locality limit is 60 km/h."},
gTn(){return"Does this sign itself introduce a 60 km/h limit?"},
gTm(){return"No. On a designated road, the rules for a populated area do not apply. Speed \u200b\u200bdepends on the road, car and other signs."},
