gTo(){return"No. The sign itself does not override the speed limit set by another sign."},
gTF(){return"Is the speed at this sign a recommendation?"},
gTE(){return"Yes. The sign recommends speed, but does not cancel mandatory restrictions and safety requirements."},
gTH(){return"Is it necessary to drive exactly at the specified speed?"},
gTG(){return"No. This is a recommended speed, not a required speed."},
gTJ(){return"Does this sign indicate a turning point?"},
gTI(){return"Yes. There is room for a turn here."},
gTL(){return"Can I turn left into the courtyard here?"},
gTK(){return"No. The sign marks the place for a U-turn and prohibits turning left."},
