gTO(){return"No. It indicates where to park, rather than requiring you to stop."},
gTB(){return"Does the sign show where to stop at a traffic signal?"},
gTA(){return"Yes. Stop in front of the sign when there is a prohibitory signal from a traffic light or a traffic controller (section 6.13)."},
